        "content": "Only fill these in for a platform that has NO official Shopify channel app installed. The Facebook & Instagram, TikTok and Google & YouTube apps already place their pixel and cover the checkout, which a theme pixel never can — filling in an ID here on top of an app double-counts every event. All pixels here are gated behind the Customer Privacy API and load only after consent."
